# The learned profile is personal + may reflect private mail. Never commit it.
# It now lives OUTSIDE the clone (~/.rahu/memory.db, or $RAHU_MEMORY_DB), so these
# entries are a safety net: they cover pre-migration profiles and anyone who points
# RAHU_MEMORY_DB back into the repo.
# NOTE: WAL mode writes -wal/-shm sidecars that hold real data too — ignore all of them.
memory.db
memory.db-wal
memory.db-shm
AUTOSEND_ENABLED
__pycache__/
